{"id":"H7073","lemma":"קְנַז","transliteration":"qenaz","sayIt":"qe-NAZ","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Kenaz","meaning":"A man of the Edomites living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.36.11;\nson of: Eliphaz (H0464);\nbrother of: Teman (H8487), Omar (H0201), Zepho (H6825), Gatam (H1609), Amalek (H6002H) and Korah (H7141H)\n§ Kenaz = \"hunter\"\n1) son of Eliphaz and grandson of Esau; one of the dukes of Edom\n2) a brother of Caleb and father of Othniel","glosses":["kenaz"],"count":11,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Kenaz"}},{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"Kenaz"}},{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":42,"renderings":{"bsb":"Kenaz","kjv":"Kenaz"}},{"chapterId":"jos-15","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"Kenaz","kjv":"of Kenaz"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-1","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"Kenaz","kjv":"of Kenaz"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-3","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"Kenaz","kjv":"of Kenaz"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-3","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Kenaz","kjv":"of Kenaz"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":36,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Kenaz","kjv":"Kenaz"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":53,"renderings":{"bsb":"Kenaz","kjv":"Kenaz"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-4","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Kenaz","kjv":"of Kenaz"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-4","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"Kenaz","kjv":"even Kenaz"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 36:11","note":"The sons of Eliphaz were Teman, Omar, Zepho, and Gatam, and Kenaz.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Joshua 15:17","note":"Othniel the son of Kenaz, the brother of Caleb, took it: and he gave him Achsah his daughter as wife.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Judges 1:13","note":"Othniel the son of Kenaz, Caleb’s younger brother, took it, so he gave him Achsah his daughter as his wife.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 1:36","note":"The sons of Eliphaz: Teman, Omar, Zephi, Gatam, Kenaz, Timna, and Amalek.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H7074","lemma":"קְנִזִּי","transliteration":"qenizzi","gloss":"Kenizzite"},{"id":